      <shape width="166.1940157480315" height="108" topLeftX="63.36" topLeftY="280.8" type="text" id="bFS">
        <content verticalAlign="top" fontSize="16" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgba(31, 35, 41, 1)" textAlign="left">
          <p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="fixed:16.50" defaultTabSize="72"><span color="rgba(90, 107, 125, 1)" fontSize="11.5" fontFamily="Heiti SC" bold="false" italic="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">Level 1–2 靠任务对照就够；Level 3–4 必须靠 no-report 与意识／无意识对照。验证问题不解决时，精度越高，错误越有说服力。</span></p>
        </content>
