        <content verticalAlign="top" paddingTop="3.6" paddingBottom="3.6" paddingLeft="7.2" paddingRight="7.2" fontSize="16" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgba(31, 35, 41, 1)" />
      </shape>
      <shape width="166.1940157480315" height="108" topLeftX="508.068031496063" topLeftY="280.8" type="text" id="buJ">
        <content verticalAlign="top" fontSize="16" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgba(31, 35, 41, 1)" textAlign="left">
          <p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="fixed:16.50" defaultTabSize="72"><span color="rgba(90, 107, 125, 1)" fontSize="11.5" fontFamily="Heiti SC" bold="false" italic="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">它能验证因果，代价是 ground truth 不再独立——所以闭环研究必须自带「自然状态基线 + 调控后对照」。</span></p>
