      <shape width="166.1940157480315" height="108" topLeftX="730.421968503937" topLeftY="280.8" type="text" id="bui">
        <content verticalAlign="top" fontSize="16" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgba(31, 35, 41, 1)" textAlign="left">
          <p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="fixed:16.50" defaultTabSize="72"><span color="rgba(90, 107, 125, 1)" fontSize="11.5" fontFamily="Heiti SC" bold="false" italic="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">前期讨论的是 mental privacy（读不读得到）；到了闭环阶段，问题变成 agency（能不能被调控、谁来授权）。03 停在隐私，08 没有展开授权。</span></p>
        </content>
      </shape>
      <shape width="870.6959842519685" height="22.1" topLeftX="44.639999999999986" topLeftY="410.4" type="text" id="bup">
        <content verticalAlign="top" fontSize="16" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgba(31, 35, 41, 1)" textAlign="left">
          <p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.2" defaultTabSize="72"><strong><span color="rgba(15, 58, 87, 1)" fontSize="14.5" fontFamily="Heiti SC" italic="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">以上四条由本次汇报引用的证据推出，不是任何一篇作者的结论；其中第 1 条与第 3 条是我认为最值得立项的两个方向。</span></strong></p>
        </content>
